WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.000
love your enemies,

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:03.400
and do good to them.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.110
And lend expecting nothing back.

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:08.610
And then you will have a great reward,

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.300
for you will be sons of the Most High God.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.810
For He is good to the ungrateful and to the wicked.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.500
Be merciful,

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.310
just as your Father is merciful.
